        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP7178, Rectangular Solid Brass Flush Pull 7\" x 1-7/8\" x 3/8\"</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull is available in 10 finishes including satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, satin brass and a lifetime polished brass. Flush pulls like this one are often used on pocket doors, but they can also be used on other sliding doors. The total projection is just .060 inches, so this flush pull has a very modern look once installed. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP7178-specifcations.gif?v=1704354617\" width=\"562\" height=\"171\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP7178 7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp40\"><b>4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/10-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp10225\"><b>10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP7178 Large 7 Inch Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .060\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening Height: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Finger Lip: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw:  #3 x 5/8\" wood screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP7178-specifications.pdf?v=1704262318\"><b>Deltana FP7178 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull | Deltana FP7178",
                "description": "Deltana FP7178, 7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull - The 7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull is available in 10 finishes including satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and a lifetime polished brass. Flush pulls like this one are often used on pocket doors, but they can also be used on other sliding doors. The total projection is just .060 inches, so this flush pull has a very modern look once installed. ",
